prompt Baton lap as bakery -- core infrastructure, Lindy first and crux first.
rota lap 5166, row 1 -- Air, the row that feels; law and boundary. Read foundations/20260823-204456_single-stranded.md. Air presses a claimed boundary to feel whether the hand passes through, and the reading pointed straight at the memo directory: both record families are single-stranded on purpose, and the SET holding them is nobody's part, so it named no maximum and grew to 56 with 51 dead.
think Round open clean at ca5f356a89. A whole lap stood parked at stash@{0} -- 288 lines of rye/src/main.rye, a control at +152, a witness at +22, and a 152-line design paper -- from a send that died. Absence scan read the paper absent here and upstream, commits_behind 0, so nothing had landed it.
think A stash replay is a merge and the conflicts that bite leave no marker, so I compared the stash base fc5b1f9281 against HEAD per path first. The three code files were byte-identical across that span; only ITINERARY, REDS and the day shelf had moved. So the code came across whole and the pins were re-derived by hand.
think Reached for them with git checkout stash@{0} -- <path>, which reads the TREE object and carries mode. A git show of the same blobs would have landed every file at 100644, which is the exec-bit law's shorter road to the same loss.
think A stale roster pass from the dead lap still held the run lock at pid 1057589, its launch_head fixed at the stash base. Resolved its cwd through /proc before signalling, TERM rather than KILL so its EXIT trap released the lock.
think Verified the rebuilt binary carries ryekey-v9 and no v8. My first check used strings, which is absent on this host, so it answered 0 for a binary that holds two copies -- a missing tool reads exactly like a clean result. grep -ac answered properly.
obs The cold endurance run refused: four paths staged and never committed. That refusal is correct -- a cold reading is of the INHERITED tree, and this round's work arrived already staged out of a stash. So this lap has a hot reading and no cold one, and says so rather than claiming both.
obs Three of the library identity's six readings cannot be isolated by any plant, because ctime moves on all of them and shadows the lot. The control states that rather than claiming six isolated plants, which is this family's own recent lesson about a paper's claim reading exactly like a proof.
obs The content stream was rebuilt from outside the program in twelve lines of Python and agreed to the character over 552 files. An independent implementation of a stream is a stronger statement than any assertion inside the program that writes it.
